<title>UK: NSW Treasury A$100 mln July 2002 fungible bond.</title>
<headline>NSW Treasury A$100 mln July 2002 fungible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW SOUTH WALES TREASURY CORP</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    08.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.435   PAY DATE  S-14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LONDON    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH A$100 MLN BOND LAUNCHED 10.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE ON COUPON DATE 08.JUL.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
